        <mxCell id="pht5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#333333;whiteSpace=wrap;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="PHASE V — Release &amp;amp; Monitor" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="34" width="870" x="860" y="2680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="start" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=40;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#ffffff;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="START" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="200" x="300" y="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Scope &amp;amp; Architect Solution ᵃ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;Baseline architecture and initial specs — ADRs, source-to-target mappings, measure definitions — drafted from CC CLI templates.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: CC → local Markdown specs · no branch yet&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="95" width="460" x="170" y="370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Create ADO Repo &amp;amp; Clone Locally ᵇ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;Create the repo in ADO, then clone it to the local workstation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: ADO + local Git · main&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="460" x="170" y="490" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;3. Provision WSs, Assign Capacity &amp;amp; Create Deployment Pipeline ᶜ ⁱ ᵛ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;Assign every WS to a Fabric capacity; bind the Shared Integration/Dev WS ↔ main; create the Test &amp;amp; Prod WSs and assign all three to deployment-pipeline stages.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: Fabric UI · WS: Dev, Test, Prod · Branch: main&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="125" width="460" x="170" y="615" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n4" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Configure MCP Servers in CC CLI ᵖ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;ms-fabric-mcp-server, powerbi-modeling-mcp registered in local config; opt-in per session.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: CC CLI config · no WS context&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="460" x="170" y="765" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n5" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;5. Scaffold Empty Fabric Artifact Shells &amp;amp; Variable Library ᵖ ᵗ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;MCP: create_lakehouse / create_pipeline / create_notebook / create_dataflow / create_semantic_model, plus the Variable Library item.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: CC/MCP · WS: Shared Integration · Branch: main&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="115" width="460" x="170" y="985" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n6" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;6. Establish Source Connectivity ˢ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;Create source connections / gateways, land raw source data, and create OneLake shortcuts into the scaffolded lakehouse — the source end of source-to-semantic-model.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: Fabric UI · WS: Shared Integration · Branch: main&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="460" x="170" y="1125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n7" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;7. Manual Fabric Source Control Commit ᵉ ᵍ ᵖ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;Scaffolded items appear as uncommitted changes — commit them from the Fabric Source Control panel.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: Fabric UI · WS: Shared Integration · Branch: main&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="460" x="170" y="1250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n8" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;8. Git Pull Locally ᶠ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;Pull folder structures / TMDL / metadata into VSC.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: local Git · Branch: main&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="85" width="460" x="170" y="1375" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n9" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;9. Refine Requirements &amp;amp; Specs ᵃ ʳ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;Re-entry point for every iteration — update the ADRs, mappings and measure definitions before any authoring begins.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: CC → local Markdown specs · Branch: main → feature/*&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="95" width="460" x="1250" y="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n10" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;10. Branch Out to Personal Dev WS ᵈ ᵛ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;Fabric SC → Branches → “Branch out to new workspace”: creates feature/x and the Personal Dev WS bound to it.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: Fabric UI · WS: Personal Dev · Branch: feature/*&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="460" x="1250" y="370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n11" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;11. Fetch &amp;amp; Checkout Feature Branch Locally ᵈ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;git fetch origin · git checkout feature/x.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: local Git · Branch: feature/*&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="85" width="460" x="1250" y="495" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n12" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;12. CC Plan Mode — Propose Implementation Plan ʳ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;CC CLI plan mode drafts the change plan against the Step 9 specs.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: CC → local plan Markdown · Branch: feature/*&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="85" width="460" x="1250" y="605" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dP" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="Plan Approved?" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="115" width="280" x="1340" y="715" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n13" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;13. Author TMDL, T-SQL &amp;amp; Pipeline JSON (incl. RLS / OLS Roles) ᵖ ᵘ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;VSC co-authoring + CC CLI local generators: stored procs, DAX measures, row- and object-level security roles, pipeline JSON. Commit the approved plan alongside the code.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: CC → local TMDL / T-SQL / JSON · Branch: feature/*&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="460" x="1250" y="855" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n14" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;14. Git Commit &amp;amp; Push to ADO ᶠ ᵍ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;Push local edits to the feature branch in ADO.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: local Git · Branch: feature/*&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="460" x="1250" y="980" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n15" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;15. Fabric SC “Update” (Pull) into Personal WS ᶠ ʰ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;Sync the Personal Dev WS to the pushed commit.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: Fabric UI · WS: Personal Dev · Branch: feature/*&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="460" x="1250" y="1080" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n16" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;16. Execute MCP-Only Operations ᵖ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;Run pipelines, Livy/Spark statements, refresh_semantic_model and validation DAX queries; poll job status.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: CC/MCP · WS: Personal Dev · Branch: feature/*&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="460" x="1250" y="1180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n17" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;17. Private Validation Loop (Personal WS) ᵖ ᵘ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;Functional checks, smoke tests and “View as role” RLS/OLS checks in the isolated Personal Dev WS.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: CC/MCP · WS: Personal Dev · Branch: feature/*&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="460" x="1250" y="1295" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d1b" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="Private Validation Passed?" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="115" width="280" x="1340" y="1410" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d1" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="More Dev Needed?" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="115" width="280" x="1340" y="1550" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n18" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;18. Fetch &amp;amp; Compare With main ʸ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;git fetch origin, then count the commits main holds that the branch lacks. Read-only — no working-tree change.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;Ctx: local Git · Branch: feature/*&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="460" x="1250" y="1690" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
